  "description": "Montage Cowboy is a bold and rugged classic western display font designed to bring an authentic vintage cowboy feel to your creative projects. Featuring strong slab serif shapes, distinctive western details, and a timeless Old West character, this font is perfect for eye-catching headlines and retro designs.\nPerfect for western logos, cowboy branding, rodeo posters, saloon signs, vintage apparel, T-shirt designs, badges, labels, posters, signage, packaging, album artwork, and rustic branding. Its bold and decorative appearance makes it especially suitable for projects that need a strong Wild West atmosphere.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Montage Cowboy is a bold and rugged classic western display font designed to bring an authentic vintage cowboy feel to your creative projects. Featuring strong slab serif shapes, distinctive western details, and a timeless Old West character, this font is perfect for eye-catching headlines and retro designs.</p>\n<p>Perfect for western logos, cowboy branding, rodeo posters, saloon signs, vintage apparel, T-shirt designs, badges, labels, posters, signage, packaging, album artwork, and rustic branding. Its bold and decorative appearance makes it especially suitable for projects that need a strong Wild West atmosphere.</p>",
